meta {
  name: Quote price
  type: http
  seq: 60
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/branches/{{branchId}}/price-quotes
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "startUtc": "2026-12-01T09:00:00Z",
    "serviceIds": ["{{serviceOfferingId}}"]
  }
}

docs {
  Staff of the company. A POST that creates nothing: answers 200 with the lines (in the order asked), the totals and whether a service is on request. startUtc is UTC (ends with Z). Up to 50 services. Run Create service offering first (it saves serviceOfferingId).
}
